ETHGas Protocol will launch a GWEI governance token. The goal is to transform the Ethereum block space $ETH  into a programmable and tradable asset.
{future}(ETHUSDT)
The total supply will be 10 billion coins, of which 10% will go to the community. The remaining assets will be distributed as follows:

31% — ecosystem;
27% — investors;
22% — team;
8% — fund;
2% — advisors

According to the developers, Ethereum remains the leading settlement layer in the crypto industry, but the current block space allocation mechanism is unable to handle application demands. The result is transaction delays and sharp spikes in fees.

To address this issue, the ETHGas team has proposed changing the access scheme to block space. Protocols will be able to pre-reserve guaranteed throughput on the secondary market, enabling a "scalable user experience without fees." #ETH $BTC $BNB

